        "original_id": "5ef2e079-cd7f-5471-9a96-77c60f29fb84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: Little Green Apples\n- People: Roger Miller, Patti Page, O. C. Smith\n- Awards: Grammy Award for Best Country Song\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100, UK Singles Chart\n\nFacts:\n- The Grammy Award for Best Country Song has been awarded since 1965.\n- Roger Miller's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became a Top 40 hit on the Billboard Hot 100 chart.\n- Roger Miller's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became a Top 40 hit on the UK Singles Chart.\n- Patti Page's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became her last Billboard Hot 100 entry.\n- O. C. Smith's version of \"Little Green Apples\" became a No. 2 hit on the Billboard Hot 100 chart.",
